BT /F1 11 Tf 15 TL 72 740 Td (Failure handling) Tj T* T* (When a server leaves, its keys fall to the next server clockwise.) Tj T* (Replication places each key on the next 3 distinct physical servers.) Tj T* (A read repair pass fixes replicas that missed writes while a server was down.) Tj T* (Rebalancing is throttled to 40 MB per second so client latency stays flat.) Tj T* ET
